While searching through dense comfier thickets high and low for any evidence of possibly nesting activity, my mom sends me a message. A ping in my pocket caused me to jump, but I quickly realized it was the buzz of my phone. Opening up my phone I immediately see a photo sent by my mom 5 minutes prior (I was out of service). The photo showed a very blurry figure stop a branch mere feet off the ground. Instantly walking to the trail she had gone walking down and I was able to spot her sitting on some fallen logs. She motioned to a tree 70 feet or so from our current location. The tall stature of the great grey blended in so well despite its size! I carefully crept along the forest floor in the birds direction, looking at the bird every few steps to check it’s behavior. Eventually the bird took off, but to my surprise it was flying towards me! It landed on this young conifer tree and allowed me to watch as it scanned the forest floor for a potential meal. Eventually this bird dove down to a stump on the forest floor and took off to hunt elsewhere. It was amazing to see one of these birds hunting in the forest so close!

#birds #birdphotography #bird #nature #birdsofinstagram #wildlife #naturephotography #wildlifephotography #birdwatching #best #photography #birdlovers #of #birding #captures #ig #perfection #naturelovers #brilliance #canon #birdstagram #nuts #about #animals #bestbirdshots #nikon #birdlife #photooftheday #your #vogelfotografie', 'datetime': '2023-08-17T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '3171679039312011844', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/622536000_18063884660280725_5589846227542942575_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=H6WisCDLXwwQ7kNvwFuOvQ5&_nc_oc=Ado77s8ejrmpR5ZLlu7N_4PkKlLHRGSgdTdX2ZhUKVc_I2AletWAZExjSgTM-_fVR4c&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=edoj170g6OQKhVhIIAy_lg&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQRflJqgRSCITX_jNJeSPxYHK8_kSxps6JgtIm8ghAa1Fg&oe=6AED3C91', 'post_hashtags': ['birds', 'birdphotography', 'bird', 'nature', 'birdsofinstagram', 'wildlife', 'naturephotography', 'wildlifephotography', 'birdwatching', 'best', 'photography', 'birdlovers', 'of', 'birding', 'captures', 'ig', 'perfection', 'naturelovers', 'brilliance', 'canon', 'birdstagram', 'nuts', 'about', 'animals', 'bestbirdshots', 'nikon', 'birdlife', 'photooftheday', 'your', 'vogelfotografie'], 'content_type': 'Image', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/CwEEUgvvqJE'}, {'caption': 'Time pauses as our car creeps around the edge of the tree line; My eyes instantly shoot to the back corner of the meadow. A familiar shape forms itself on a branch about 40 yards back. “Great grey!” I excitedly tell my mother who’s instant reaction was “no way”. Sure enough as we creep out of the car we see the haunting figure of the grey ghost. As I crept along the tree line I stopped at a safe distance and fired away these shots. It’s a miracle any of these images turned out ok because I was shaking like a leaf! As I made my way back to the car I felt emotions I have never felt with a bird well up; The culmination of hours of work payed off with dream shots. From that point on We were able to watch this bird hunting from dawn to midday. This was hands down the most amazing moment in my photography journey thus far. But maybe that would soon change 🤔

#birds #birdphotography #bird #nature #birdsofinstagram #wildlife #naturephotography #wildlifephotography #birdwatching #best #photography #birdlovers #of #birding #captures #ig #perfection #naturelovers #brilliance #canon #birdstagram #nuts #about #animals #bestbirdshots #nikon #birdlife #photooftheday #your #vogelfotografie', 'datetime': '2023-08-16T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '3170748444594663624', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/619761351_17969687732868218_2850536716158514998_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=nFD4wEPJqpoQ7kNvwE2lBgU&_nc_oc=AdpDx0plPs9K_W-zzl-g8VGtuoSeCXUys3Pd-qe2rgCWfoODwIpt-Ow61Zrk5ew0bPA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=edoj170g6OQKhVhIIAy_lg&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQSgKO53dEMu-k8ZPy6gQaSd7qLsJFvJGa3wpiC6U4DB7Q&oe=6AED4D4C', 'post_hashtags': ['birds', 'birdphotography', 'bird', 'nature', 'birdsofinstagram', 'wildlife', 'naturephotography', 'wildlifephotography', 'birdwatching', 'best', 'photography', 'birdlovers', 'of', 'birding', 'captures', 'ig', 'perfection', 'naturelovers', 'brilliance', 'canon', 'birdstagram', 'nuts', 'about', 'animals', 'bestbirdshots', 'nikon', 'birdlife', 'photooftheday', 'your', 'vogelfotografie'], 'content_type': 'Image', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/CwAwuk4L_DI'}, {'caption': 'Oak rockstar 🌳👨‍🎤 

New life begins once again, the canopy’s are filled with the chatters of oak titmice, dark eyed juncos, and the whistle calls of pacific slope flycatchers. The occasional sharp scream of a red shouldered hawk cuts the chatter, leaving moments of silence, when all birds seem to freeze; only to resume to their busy lives moments later. I have had the fortune of watching one small portion of these birds lives and it’s happened to be the most special. Watching these parents slave away to feed their constantly growing hatchlings was a truly special experience. Although this is my final post in my series of images captured at my grandmas house, I hope you all were able to take away a small glimpse at the beauty I have been able to observe in my time around her property. Thank you all for reading, it was a pleasure to share these images with you.

